# pipe-authority-downstream — authority is checked at every gate a token
# reaches over pipes, not only at the source (specification §5.1, §7.1). a is
# granted at A only; A pipes to terminal B, where a holds no grant, so B is
# refused and the master withholds.
actor a
gate  A grant a
gate  B
cord a -> A
cord A -> B
cord B -> master
